#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:5 bbfe9543bf9b44f392047b98f26d8608
msgid "Archived: Quick Start Guide for Ready-to-Fly Vehicles"
msgstr "已归档：即飞（RTF）飞行器快速入门指南"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:9 5ea26739d39a455c913b146d67758c21
msgid "**ARCHIVED ARTICLE**"
msgstr "**已归档文章**"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:11 0c07273f33fd4b3dbbe8067188d5727a
msgid ""
"The article is out of date (3DR replaced APM2.x with Pixhawk and the kits "
"come with everything configured out of the box). In addition, 3DR no longer "
"supplies hardware described in this article (including Iris+, Solo, X8, "
"Aero-M)."
msgstr ""
"本文章已过时（3DR已用Pixhawk取代APM2.x，套件开箱即可使用）。此外，3DR已不再提供本文所述的硬件（包括Iris+、Solo、X8、Aero-M）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:15 69906132635145f6a329d234425e6836
msgid ""
"This page is a quick start guide for users who have purchased a *3DRobotics "
"Ready-to-Fly (RTF) multicopter* including a Pixhawk preloaded with the "
"latest Copter firmware. All other users should skip to the :ref:`First Time "
"Setup <initial-setup>` section which includes the full autopilot set-up and "
"calibration instructions."
msgstr ""
"本页面是为购买了*3DRobotics即飞（RTF）多旋翼飞行器*（包含预装最新Copter固件的Pixhawk）的用户提供的快速入门指南。其他用户请跳至"
" :ref:`First Time Setup <initial-setup>` 部分，其中包含完整的飞控设置和校准说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:21 06721e06960a4823bc065cc9260247f3
msgid "Install Mission Planner"
msgstr "安装 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:23 1b3a90dffaad47479f724094af322b20
msgid ""
"`Download the most recent Mission Planner MSI from here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MissionPlanner/MissionPlanner-"
"latest.msi>`__."
msgstr ""
"`从此处下载最新的 Mission Planner MSI安装包 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MissionPlanner/MissionPlanner-"
"latest.msi>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:25 c1f002f6008547528c0ce946f295fd85
msgid ""
"Open the Microsoft installer file (.msi) and select **Run** to run the "
"installation utility."
msgstr "打开Microsoft安装文件（.msi），选择**运行**以启动安装程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:31 3f4a2de926964c2fb5636b484f9c5139
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions to complete the setup process (accept the license "
"terms, choose a location for the installation etc.)"
msgstr "按照说明完成安装过程（接受许可条款、选择安装位置等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:34 e9d2f338ad134b95a4166e18858dc95d
msgid ""
"The installation utility will automatically install any necessary software "
"drivers. If you receive a DirectX installation error, please update your "
"DirectX plug-in from the `Windows Download Center "
"<https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/download/windows.aspx>`__. If you receive "
"the warning pictured here, select **Install this driver software anyway** to"
" continue."
msgstr ""
"安装程序将自动安装所需的软件驱动程序。如果收到DirectX安装错误，请从 `Windows下载中心 "
"<https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/download/windows.aspx>`__ "
"更新DirectX插件。如果收到此处显示的警告，请选择**仍然安装此驱动程序软件**以继续。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:41 d68c481ee819402cbf89dce27ee6d917
msgid ""
"Once installation is complete, open Mission Planner. Mission Planner "
"automatically notifies you about available updates. Please always run the "
"most current version of Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"安装完成后，打开 Mission Planner。Mission Planner会自动通知您有可用更新。请始终运行最新版本的 Mission "
"Planner。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:46 d847a178a5f74434917e7fef9e145637
msgid "Connect RC receiver"
msgstr "连接RC接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:48 cb706c31e72641998d66addab29eb73e
msgid ""
"Is your RC receiver already connected and configured? If not, follow these "
"instructions."
msgstr "您的RC接收机是否已连接并配置好？如果没有，请按照以下说明操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:51 a01f7177ebc143708656705af74db2bf
msgid ""
"For RC control with \\ **PWM**, connect RC receiver to APM Input Signal pins"
" using connectors to attach channel 1 to the APM signal pin labeled 1, "
"channel 2 to signal pin 2, etc. You will also need to provide power to the "
"receiver by connecting a three-wire cable between the receiver and the APM "
"for one of the channels."
msgstr ""
"使用\\ "
"**PWM**进行RC控制时，使用连接器将RC接收机连接到APM输入信号引脚，将通道1连接到标有1的APM信号引脚，通道2连接到信号引脚2，以此类推。您还需要通过某一通道的三芯线缆为接收机提供电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:60 a403fd38af0a47b392175854810681ee
msgid ""
"For **PPM** (all channels over one wire), use PPM jumper connectors to "
"connect Input signal pins 2 and 3 on APM and signal pins 3 and 4 on the "
"receiver. Use a 3-wire cable to connect the signal, power, and ground pins "
"for channel 1 on the receiver to the three pins labeled 1 on APM. The "
"specific pins used for the receiver may vary by model, so consult the "
"documentation on your receiver for PPM configuration."
msgstr ""
"使用**PPM**（单线多通道）时，使用PPM跳线连接APM的输入信号引脚2和3以及接收机的信号引脚3和4。使用3芯线缆将接收机通道1的信号、电源和地引脚连接到APM上标有1的三个引脚。具体引脚因接收机型号而异，请查阅接收机说明书进行PPM配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:70 0a7ea84a956c4127b64aeddbadbd2f76
msgid ""
"Once you've downloaded Mission Planner onto your ground station computer, "
"connect APM to your computer using the micro USB connector and APM's micro "
"USB port. Use a direct USB port on your computer, not a USB hub."
msgstr ""
"将 Mission Planner 下载到地面站电脑后，使用Micro USB连接器和APM的Micro "
"USB接口将APM连接到电脑。请使用电脑的直接USB端口，而非USB集线器。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:78 cdd7796bcaaa40be880a4ad190286757
msgid ""
"Windows will automatically detect APM and install the correct driver "
"software."
msgstr "Windows将自动检测APM并安装正确的驱动程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:81 f350d99f758f429893d9ad68f31a5cac
msgid ""
"Next we'll let Mission Planner know which port we're using to connect to "
"APM. Open Mission Planner, and use the drop-down menus in the upper-right "
"corner of the screen (near the Connect button) to connect to APM. Select \\ "
"**Arduino Mega 2560** and set the Baud rate to **115200** as shown."
msgstr ""
"接下来，我们告知 Mission Planner 连接APM所使用的端口。打开 Mission "
"Planner，在屏幕右上角（连接按钮附近）的下拉菜单中连接到APM。选择\\ **Arduino Mega "
"2560**并将波特率设置为**115200**，如图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:90 2f61c7ef71af4fce9dc77a1ab10f8f4d
msgid ""
"Select \\ **Connect** (upper-right corner of the screen) to load MavLink "
"parameters to APM. Mission Planner will display a window showing the "
"progress of the MavLink download."
msgstr ""
"选择\\ **连接**（屏幕右上角）以将MavLink参数加载到APM。Mission Planner 将显示一个窗口，显示MavLink下载进度。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:97 f6d814b44a6243bea67cb533b5ed4990
msgid ""
"When the window displays **Done** and Mission Planner shows the "
"**Disconnect** option in place of Connect, your APM firmware has been "
"downloaded successfully."
msgstr "当窗口显示**完成**，且 Mission Planner 在连接位置显示**断开连接**选项时，说明APM固件已成功下载。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:104
#: 0239ef059e4544549d5b0013ca397345
msgid ""
"Turn on transmitter. Verify that the transmitter is in Airplane mode (APM "
"needs airplane mode regardless of the platform type being piloted) and all "
"trims are centered."
msgstr "打开遥控器。确认遥控器处于飞机模式（无论飞行平台类型，APM均需要飞机模式），且所有微调居中。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:108
#: 01523abba36249d78685b0b0387edbc2
msgid "Transmitter(Mode 2): Recommended Channels"
msgstr "遥控器（Mode 2）：推荐通道分配"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:110
#: 40ab357f9a664977bee3b14c83e53126
msgid ""
"The left stick will control throttle and yaw; the right stick will control "
"roll and pitch. The three-position switch will control flight modes."
msgstr "左摇杆控制油门和偏航，右摇杆控制横滚和俯仰。三段拨杆控制飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:114
#: 635e367a29534e6483041ab2d21d2e27
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner, select **Mandatory Hardware** and **Radio Calibration**."
" Click on the green \\ **Calibrate Radio** button in the lower right of the "
"window. Mission Planner will call a dialog window to ensure radio control "
"equipment is on, battery is not connected, and propellers are not attached."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 中，选择**Mandatory Hardware**和**Radio "
"Calibration**。点击窗口右下角的绿色\\ **Calibrate Radio**按钮。Mission Planner "
"会弹出对话框，确认遥控设备已开启、电池未连接且螺旋桨未安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:123
#: ab888321839042c58941e26653662bdc
msgid ""
"Select OK; move the control sticks and toggle switches on your transmitter "
"to their limits of travel and observe the results on the radio calibration "
"bars. Red lines will appear across the calibration bars to indicate maximum "
"and minimum values. Move the Ch 5 and 6 toggle switches through their range "
"of positions (Ch 7 and 8 are not used for basic operations)."
msgstr ""
"点击确定；移动遥控器的控制摇杆和拨动开关至行程极限，观察无线电校准条上的结果。红线将显示在校准条上，表示最大值和最小值。将第5和第6通道拨动开关拨至其行程范围内的各个位置（第7和第8通道不用于基本操作）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:130
#: 4aa1d04d21904d5e98a72ae50bd3ce10
msgid "Your transmitter should cause the following control changes:"
msgstr "您的遥控器应产生以下控制变化："

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:132
#: 8303b142646c4b3f9d2dad0b5f1dcafd
msgid "Channel 1: low = roll left, high = roll right."
msgstr "通道1：低值=左横滚，高值=右横滚。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:134
#: 079cc6b1892d42c8a6ddf5d3c8c4d037
msgid "Channel 2: low = pitch forward, high=pitch back."
msgstr "通道2：低值=俯仰向前，高值=俯仰向后。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:136
#: 14028262f74a479d99aacefefc8c3db8
msgid "Channel 3: low = throttle down (off), high = throttle up."
msgstr "通道3：低值=油门关小（关），高值=油门加大。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:138
#: a83890431e2a4a1cb92411edc997dc93
msgid "Channel 4: low = yaw left, high = yaw right."
msgstr "通道4：低值=左偏航，高值=右偏航。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:143
#: d92b3371f55c4813af33b3527f2b0a49
msgid ""
"When the red bars for roll, pitch, throttle, yaw, and radio 5 (and "
"optionally radio 6) are set at the minimum and maximum positions, select "
"**Click when Done**. Mission Planner will show a summary of the calibration "
"data. Normal values are around 1100 for minimums and 1900 for maximums."
msgstr ""
"当横滚、俯仰、油门、偏航以及无线电5（以及可选的无线电6）的红色指示条均已设置至最小和最大位置后，选择**Click when "
"Done**。Mission Planner 将显示校准数据摘要。正常值约为最小值1100、最大值1900。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:153
#: 47fe04415eed43cb987df15176a96cf4
msgid "Attach propellers"
msgstr "安装螺旋桨"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:155
#: 862468c69c244d9aac60baa49755ce32
msgid ""
"Unscrew prop nuts and add propellers to motor collets with writing on props "
"facing up in relation to the sky. If you have a co-axial motor "
"configuration, make sure that the writing on the props faces up even if the "
"motor faces down. Add metal spacers on top of prop nuts if prop hub measures"
" less than 5 mm in height. Tighten prop nuts to secure propellers in place. "
"Try inserting a 2 mm (5/64) hex wrench into the hole in the side of the prop"
" nut to get better leverage when tightening prop nuts. Select propellers "
"based on motor directions. Find your frame in the images below. Use pusher "
"propellers for motors marked clockwise and normal propellers marked "
"counterclockwise. Pusher propellers are usually marked \"P\" or \"SFP\" on "
"the propeller."
msgstr ""
"拧开螺旋桨螺母，将螺旋桨安装到电机夹头上，螺旋桨上的字面应朝上（相对于天空方向）。如果使用同轴电机配置，即使电机朝下，螺旋桨上的字也应朝上。如果螺旋桨毂高度小于5毫米，请在螺旋桨螺母上方加装金属垫片。拧紧螺旋桨螺母以固定螺旋桨。尝试将2毫米（5/64英寸）六角扳手插入螺旋桨螺母侧面的孔中，以获得更好的力矩来拧紧螺旋桨螺母。根据电机转向选择螺旋桨。在下方图示中找到您的机架类型。顺时针转向电机使用推进桨，逆时针转向电机使用正桨。推进桨通常在螺旋桨上标有\"P\"或\"SFP\"字样。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:177
#: 233ff3f01cfc4053af531884b04574bd
msgid "Pre-flight information"
msgstr "飞行前信息"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:179
#: e67cd00256a94f3ab9f17b1b89dd4620
msgid ""
"Safety is the key to successful flight. Please read the \\ :ref:`Safety "
"Information Page <safety-multicopter>` before flying. Select an unpopulated "
"area to fly your copter, away from people and developed areas, and always "
"run the :ref:`pre-flight checklist <checklist>`\\ before connecting the "
"battery. Make sure to read the :ref:`Flying <flying-arducopter>` page for "
"information about arming, disarming, and controlling your copter during "
"flight."
msgstr ""
"安全是成功飞行的关键。飞行前请阅读\\ :ref:`Safety Information Page <safety-"
"multicopter>`。请选择空旷地带飞行，远离人群和建筑区域，并在连接电池前始终执行 :ref:`pre-flight checklist "
"<checklist>`\\ 。请务必阅读 :ref:`Flying <flying-arducopter>` "
"页面，了解解锁、上锁和在飞行中控制飞行器的相关信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:185
#: e45b704e4e54473b95b06911ce38c6d0
msgid ""
"When you're ready to fly, place copter on the ground facing away from you. "
"Connect fully charged LiPo battery to the power module connector when you're"
" ready to power on your copter. Follow the safe arming and disarming "
"procedure described on the :ref:`Maiden Flight <flying-arducopter>` page."
msgstr ""
"准备好飞行后，将飞行器放置在地面上，机头朝前背向您。准备好启动时，将充满电的LiPo电池连接到电源模块接口。请按照 :ref:`Maiden "
"Flight <flying-arducopter>` 页面上描述的安全解锁和上锁程序操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:194
#: 6755261d797e48acb119417ced70da86
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "下一步"

#: ../../source/docs/quick-start-guide.rst:196
#: 4979bed991534cd3b3a32415dce15dfe
msgid ""
"Try learning about different :ref:`autonomous flight modes <flight-modes>` "
"to get the most out of your Copter, including loitering and running "
"missions."
msgstr "尝试了解不同的 :ref:`自主飞行模式 <flight-modes>`，充分发挥Copter的性能，包括悬停和执行任务。"
